‪It's coming closer.

1730
01:22:52,717 --> 01:22:54,636
‪-Is it?
‪-It is.

1731
01:22:55,345 --> 01:22:57,597
<i>‪There was complete darkness,</i>

1732
01:22:57,681 --> 01:22:59,891
<i>‪and then there was a burst of light.</i>

1733
01:22:59,975 --> 01:23:04,187
<i>‪Then it just started coming towards us,</i>
<i>‪growing as it came closer.</i>

1734
01:23:04,270 --> 01:23:06,189
‪"When day turns to night,

1735
01:23:06,272 --> 01:23:08,233
‪you can see the path."

1736
01:23:08,316 --> 01:23:11,403
<i>‪Stella's translation</i>
<i>‪of the ancient prophecy was right.</i>

1737
01:23:11,486 --> 01:23:12,862
‪Are you watching, Stella?

1738
01:23:13,363 --> 01:23:15,490
‪Stella, this is it.

1739
01:23:15,991 --> 01:23:18,201
‪-This is what we were waiting to see.
‪-This is it.

1740
01:23:18,868 --> 01:23:20,203
‪This is amazing.

1741
01:23:21,705 --> 01:23:23,123
‪I wanna see the actual game too.

1742
01:23:24,249 --> 01:23:26,960
‪-Yeah, I'm dying to know.
‪-Me too.

1743
01:23:27,043 --> 01:23:28,545
