1744
01:23:29,587 --> 01:23:32,132
‪Man, this is just incredible.

1745
01:23:34,134 --> 01:23:35,176
‪That looks so fun.

1746
01:23:35,260 --> 01:23:36,344
‪I'll see you later.

1747
01:23:36,428 --> 01:23:37,846
‪-I had a lot of fun.
‪-Me too.

1748
01:23:37,929 --> 01:23:38,972
‪-Well done.
‪-I had a blast.

1749
01:23:39,055 --> 01:23:41,558
‪If I don't succeed,
‪please carry on and see it through.

1750
01:23:43,143 --> 01:23:45,520
‪-You got this. Good luck!
‪-We'll be cheering you on.

1751
01:23:45,603 --> 01:23:47,605
‪You deserve this. Take care.

1752
01:23:47,689 --> 01:23:48,773
‪Let's go!

1753
01:23:50,316 --> 01:23:52,318
‪I'm leaving the exile zone first.

1754
01:23:52,402 --> 01:23:54,237
<i>‪I know there's a risk of elimination,</i>

1755
01:23:54,320 --> 01:23:57,699
<i>‪but I still wanna </i><i>‪do</i>
<i>‪as much as I can and </i><i>‪pull </i><i>‪my </i><i>‪weight.</i>

1756
01:23:58,283 --> 01:24:00,535
<i>‪That's why I feel so alive</i>
<i>‪and </i><i>‪confident </i><i>‪right </i><i>‪now.</i>

1757
01:24:00,618 --> 01:24:03,371
‪Go make them tell you,
‪"You're brilliant at this."

1758
01:24:05,874 --> 01:24:08,251
‪The man of hidden stages.

1759
01:24:16,843 --> 01:24:19,095
‪There really is a black hole
‪at the end of the path.

1760
01:24:22,015 --> 01:24:23,266
‪You're right.

1761
01:24:23,349 --> 01:24:24,934
‪This is so cool.

1762
01:24:30,607 --> 01:24:33,068
‪The curiosity is actually killing me.

1763
01:24:34,694 --> 01:24:35,653
‪Unreal.

1764
01:24:38,656 --> 01:24:40,325
‪-Good luck!
‪-You got this!

1765
01:24:40,909 --> 01:24:41,868
‪I got this!

1766
01:24:44,370 --> 01:24:46,039
‪Oh my gosh! He's gone!

